## ADR-072 — 3-factor restoration RCA (2026-06-04)
The empty-sidebar / auditor-crash incident was restored by THREE
concurrent factors. Single-factor sufficiency is NOT proven and will
NOT be tested in production. Any isolation experiment must happen in a
non-prod copy.

1. Forced republish (r3 3-file diff) — shipped CAPA code that was in
   source but missing from the previously deployed bundle.
2. `system_settings.menu_overrides_enabled = false` at 07:06:15 UTC.
3. All active `menu_overrides` rows cleared.

Baseline invariants I1–I4 (see `docs/adr/ADR-072.md` and `POLICY.md`
§Menu-CAPA) are now the authoritative contract.